==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Charizard}}.
*'''Stoke''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Blaine's Growlithe|62}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*'''Steam Artillery''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Turtonator|27}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.

